<title>USA: NRC removes NYPA's Indian Pt 3 nuke from watchlist.</title>
<headline>NRC removes NYPA's Indian Pt 3 nuke from watchlist.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKVILLE, MD. 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Nuclear Regulatory Commission said Wednesday it would remove New York Power Authority's Indian Point three nuclear plant from the agency's watchlist.</p>
<p>In documents distributed at the start of an NRC meeting today, NRC regional administrators said they would remove the plant located near Buchanan, New York, from the list after four years of upgrades and improvements in operations.</p>
</text>
